WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.135 --> 00:00:05.939
&gt;&gt;&gt; U.S. VETERAN DANE PARTRIDGE
HAS BECOME THE FIFTH KNOWN

00:00:05.939 --> 00:00:08.741
AMERICAN TO BE KILLED WILD
VOLUNTEERING IN UKRAINE.

00:00:08.741 --> 00:00:12.612
HE DIED THIS WEEK FROM INJURIES
THAT HE SUSTAINED AFTER HE AND

00:00:12.612 --> 00:00:17.884
OTHERS WERE AMBUSHED BY TWO
RUSSIAN VEHICLES WHILE THEY WERE

00:00:17.884 --> 00:00:20.386
CLEARING TRENCHES.
THE FATHER OF FIVE SUFFERED A

00:00:20.386 --> 00:00:23.256
BROKEN NECK AND WOUNDS TO HIS
BRAIN FROM SHRAPNEL.

00:00:23.256 --> 00:00:27.660
HE WAS IN A COMA FOR EIGHT DAYS
AND HE PASSED AWAY IN A

00:00:27.660 --> 00:00:29.929
ZAPORIZHZHIA HOSPITAL ON TUESDAY
WHILE STILL ON LIFE SUPPORT.

00:00:29.929 --> 00:00:32.832
HE HAD BEEN FIGHT AGO LONG SIDE
UKRAINIANS SINCE APRIL AND

00:00:32.832 --> 00:00:38.004
JOINING US NOW IS DANE'S SISTER,
JENNY CORRY, I'M SO SORRY FOR

00:00:38.004 --> 00:00:41.007
YOUR LOSS AND FOR THE LOSS OF
YOUR FAMILY.

00:00:41.007 --> 00:00:44.377
HOW ARE YOU DOING AND HOW ARE
YOU REFLECTING ON WHAT YOUR

00:00:44.377 --> 00:00:50.416
BROTHER WAS DOING AT THE TIME
THAT HE DIED?

00:00:50.416 --> 00:00:57.123
&gt;&gt; WE'RE DOING OKAY.
OBVIOUSLY WE'RE DEVASTATED.

00:00:57.123 --> 00:01:03.763
AT THIS NEWS.
BUT WE -- WE BELIEVE AND KNOW

00:01:03.763 --> 00:01:08.434
THAT HE PAID THE ULTIMATE
SACRIFICE AND WE HAD MANY

00:01:08.434 --> 00:01:11.538
CONVERSATIONS ABOUT HOW HE JUST
FELT LIKE HE NEEDED TO SERVE AND

00:01:11.538 --> 00:01:14.974
BE THERE FOR HIS FELLOW MEN AND
SO THAT IS HOW WE'RE GOING TO GO

00:01:14.974 --> 00:01:18.711
ON HONORING HIS NAME AND TELLING
HIS STORY.

00:01:18.711 --> 00:01:22.515
&gt;&gt; AND REMEMBERING HIM THROUGH
HIS STORIES AND FOR HIS CHILDREN

00:01:22.515 --> 00:01:26.286
AS WELL.
I KNOW HE BOUGHT A ONE-WAY

00:01:26.286 --> 00:01:29.222
TICKET TO POLAND.
HE DID SOMETHING THAT ACTUALLY

00:01:29.222 --> 00:01:32.025
MANY SERVICE MEMBERS DO BEFORE
GOING INTO SERVICE.

00:01:32.025 --> 00:01:36.796
WHICH IS HE PREPARED.
HE DRAFTED HIS WILL.

00:01:36.796 --> 00:01:41.467
DID YOU HAVE TOUGH
CONVERSATIONS --

00:01:41.467 --> 00:01:42.568
&gt;&gt; YES.
&gt;&gt; -- BEFORE HE LEFT ABOUT WHAT

00:01:42.568 --> 00:01:44.671
THE POSSIBILITY OF WHAT COULD
HAPPEN?

00:01:44.671 --> 00:01:51.110
&gt;&gt; WE TALKED ABOUT IT.
IT IS INTERESTING, BECAUSE PART

00:01:51.110 --> 00:01:58.384
OF OUR CONVERSATION WAS IN HIS
EARLIER YEARS, HE HAD RIGHT OUT

00:01:58.384 --> 00:02:02.789
OF HIGH SCHOOL AND HE HAD JOINED
THE ARMY AND FOUGHT FOR

00:02:02.789 --> 00:02:05.024
OPERATION IRAQI FREEDOM.
HE SAID THIS TIME.

00:02:05.024 --> 00:02:07.793
WHEN I WENT TO IRAQ, I WAS
SCARED.

00:02:07.793 --> 00:02:14.033
THIS TIME I HAD SUCH A STRONG
CONVICTION AND I KNEW WITH EVERY

00:02:14.033 --> 00:02:20.139
BONE IN MY BODY THIS IS RIGHT
AND I'M NOT SCARED AND I KNOW

00:02:20.139 --> 00:02:22.842
VERY LIKELY THAT I'M NOT GOING
TO COME BACK.

00:02:22.842 --> 00:02:25.979
&gt;&gt; HE THOUGHT THAT.
HE THOUGHT HE MIGHT NOT COME

00:02:25.979 --> 00:02:28.581
BACK.
BUT HE THOUGHT IT WAS WORTH IT.

00:02:28.581 --> 00:02:31.751
COULD YOU TELL ME MORE ABOUT WHY
HE THOUGHT IT WAS WORTH IT

00:02:31.751 --> 00:02:40.026
CONSIDERING HE HAD SO MUCH AT
HOME TO LIVE FOR?

00:02:40.026 --> 00:02:46.532
&gt;&gt; YOU SAW A NOBLE CAUSE AND HE
WANTED TO GO FIGHT FOR IT.

00:02:46.532 --> 00:02:52.872
AND HE'S THE KIND OF FAITH-BASED
MAN THAT WHEN GETS A PIERCING IN

00:02:52.872 --> 00:02:56.042
HIS HEART AND HE KNOWS THAT HE
BELIEVES THAT WITH EVERY BONE IN

00:02:56.042 --> 00:03:01.080
HIS BODY, HE CAN'T DENY THAT AND
HE WANTED TO HONOR HIS GOD AN

00:03:01.080 --> 00:03:04.417
THE CONVICTION THAT HE GOT TO GO
FIGHT.

00:03:04.417 --> 00:03:07.687
&gt;&gt; CAN YOU TELL US A LITTLE BIT
ABOUT HIM, JENNY.

00:03:07.687 --> 00:03:10.489
YOU'VE TOLD US ABOUT HIS
CONVICTIONS AND OBVIOUSLY WE

00:03:10.489 --> 00:03:14.127
KNOW ABOUT HIS WILLINGNESS TO
SACRIFICE FOR THOSE CONVICTIONS.

00:03:14.127 --> 00:03:19.265
COULD YOU TELL US A LITTLE BIT
MORE ABOUT HIM?

00:03:19.265 --> 00:03:24.304
&gt;&gt; YES.
HE WAS KIND OF GUY THAT HE WOULD

00:03:24.304 --> 00:03:27.774
HELP ANYBODY.
BUT HE ALSO LIKED BEING THE LIFE

00:03:27.774 --> 00:03:31.677
OF THE PARTIES.
HE WAS A TALL, KIND OF A LOUD

00:03:31.677 --> 00:03:34.580
BOOMING VOICE AND YOU KNEW HE
WAS IN THE ROOM.

00:03:34.580 --> 00:03:36.249
AND HE LOVED TO MAKE PEOPLE
LAUGH.

00:03:36.249 --> 00:03:42.322
HE LOVED TO BE WITTY.
IF YOU WERE SAD, HE WANTED TO

00:03:42.322 --> 00:03:44.290
CLEAR YOU UP.
HE DIDN'T TALK MUCH ABOUT

00:03:44.290 --> 00:03:46.926
HIMSELF WHEN HE WAS OVER THERE
BECAUSE HE DIDN'T WANT US TO

00:03:46.926 --> 00:03:53.766
WORRY, HE JUST WANTED US TO
CONNECT AT HOME AND KEEP THINGS

00:03:53.766 --> 00:03:57.970
AS HAPPY AS HE COULD SO THAT WE
WEREN'T WORRYING SO MUCH FOR

00:03:57.970 --> 00:04:01.207
HIM.
BUT HE WAS ONE TO -- WHEN HE SAW

00:04:01.207 --> 00:04:04.176
A NEED, HE WAS GOING TO REACH
OUT AND HE WAS GOING TO TAKE

00:04:04.176 --> 00:04:06.612
CARE OF SOMEBODY WHETHER THEY
NEEDED HELP, WHETHER THEY WERE

00:04:06.612 --> 00:04:10.283
SAD, WHETHER THEY NEEDED
CHEERING UP.

00:04:10.283 --> 00:04:14.954
HE JUST WANTED TO BE THAT PERSON
TO LIFT PEOPLE UP.

00:04:14.954 --> 00:04:18.557
&gt;&gt; JENNY, HE SOUNDS LIKE HE WAS
AN AMAZING PERSON.

00:04:18.557 --> 00:04:22.895
AND I'M SO SORRY FOR WHAT YOU
ARE GOING THROUGH AND FOR WHAT

00:04:22.895 --> 00:04:27.200
YOUR FAMILY IS GOING THROUGH.
AND I THANK YOU FOR YOUR SHARING

00:04:27.200 --> 00:04:30.136
A LITTLE BIT ABOUT HIM WITH US
THIS MORNING.

00:04:30.136 --> 00:04:30.903
JENNY CORRY, THANK YOU. 

